  "content": "<p>Lockheed Martin Corporation is a global security and aerospace company that is principally engaged in the research, design, development, manufacture, integration, and sustainment of advanced technology systems, products, and services. As a leading defense contractor, the company operates through four primary business segments: Aeronautics, Missiles and Fire Control, Rotary and Mission Systems, and Space. Lockheed Martin is renowned for producing iconic platforms such as the F-35 Lightning II, C-130 Hercules, and various missile defense systems, serving both domestic and international military and government customers.</p>\n",
  "tabs": [
    {
      "label": "Management",
      "content": "<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 24px;\">Officers</h2><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/James%20Taiclet\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">James Taiclet</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">June 2020</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chairman, President and Chief Executive Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Taiclet has served as Chairman, President and Chief Executive Officer of Lockheed Martin since June 2020. He previously served as Chairman, President and Chief Executive Officer of American Tower Corporation.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Jesus%20Malave\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Jesus Malave</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">February 2022</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chief Financial Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Malave has served as Chief Financial Officer since February 2022. He previously served as Senior Vice President and Chief Financial Officer of L3Harris Technologies, Inc.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Frank%20St.%20John\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Frank St. John</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">June 2020</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chief Operating Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. St. John has served as Chief Operating Officer since June 2020. He has held various leadership roles at Lockheed Martin for over 30 years.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Evan%20Scott\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Evan Scott</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2023</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Senior Vice President, General Counsel and Corporate Secretary</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Scott has served as Senior Vice President, General Counsel and Corporate Secretary since 2023.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Bruce%20Carlson\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Bruce Carlson</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">July 1, 2015</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Member, Board of Directors</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Retired General, U.S. Air Force and former Director of the National Reconnaissance Office.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Christopher%20Kubasik\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Christopher Kubasik</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2010</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">President and Chief Operating Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Kubasik has served as Chair and Chief Executive Officer since June 2022. He previously served as Vice Chair, President and Chief Executive Officer from June 2021 to June 2022, and as Vice Chair, President and Chief Operating Officer from June 2019 to June 2021. Prior to the L3Harris merger, he was Chairman, President and CEO of L3 Technologies.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Daniel%20Akerson\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Daniel Akerson</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">February 2014</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Former Chairman and CEO of General Motors Company.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/David%20Burritt\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">David Burritt</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2008</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">President and CEO of United States Steel Corporation.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Debra%20Reed-Klages\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Debra Reed-Klages</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2019</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Former Executive Chairman, President and CEO of Sempra Energy.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/DeEtte%20Gray\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">DeEtte Gray</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">1999</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Various Executive/Management roles in IT services</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Ms. Gray has served as President of Business and Information Technology Solutions since 2017. Prior to CACI, she held leadership roles at BAE Systems.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Gregory%20Dahlberg\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Gregory Dahlberg</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2001</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Senior Vice President, Washington Operations</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Gregory R. Dahlberg previously served as Senior Vice President for Strategic Planning at Lockheed Martin Corporation and as Under Secretary of the Army.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Ilene%20Gordon\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Ilene Gordon</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">June 2016</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Retired Chairman, President and CEO of Ingredion Incorporated.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Jeh%20Johnson\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Jeh Johnson</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2018</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Partner at Paul, Weiss, Rifkind, Wharton & Garrison LLP and former U.S. Secretary of Homeland Security.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/John%20Donovan\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">John Donovan</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2021</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Former CEO of AT&T Communications, LLC. He has served on our board since September 2021.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/John%20Mengucci\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">John Mengucci</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">Prior to 2012</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">President, Information Systems and Global Solutions (Civil and Defense segments)</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Mengucci has served as President and Chief Executive Officer of CACI since July 2019. He previously served as Chief Operating Officer from 2012 to 2019. Before joining CACI, he held leadership positions at Lockheed Martin Corporation.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/John%20Richardson\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">John Richardson</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2024</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Retired Admiral, U.S. Navy and former Chief of Naval Operations.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Joseph%20Dunford%2C%20Jr.\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Joseph Dunford, Jr.</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">February 2020</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Retired General, U.S. Marine Corps and former Chairman of the Joint Chiefs of Staff.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Judith%20Marks\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Judith Marks</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">1994</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Senior Leadership Roles (including Vice President)</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Chair, CEO and President of Otis Worldwide Corporation.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Linda%20Gooden\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Linda Gooden</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2007</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Executive Vice President, Information Systems & Global Solutions</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Former Executive Vice President, Information Systems & Global Solutions of Lockheed Martin Corporation.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Marillyn%20Hewson\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Marillyn Hewson</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2013</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chairman, President, and Chief Executive Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Former Chairman, President and CEO of Lockheed Martin Corporation. Director since 2021.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Maryanne%20Lavan\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Maryanne Lavan</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2007</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Senior Vice President, General Counsel, and Corporate Secretary</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Ms. Lavan is Senior Vice President, General Counsel and Corporate Secretary of Lockheed Martin Corporation. She has held various leadership positions at Lockheed Martin since 1990.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Orlando%20Carvalho\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Orlando Carvalho</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2006</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Executive Vice President, Aeronautics</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Carvalho previously served as Executive Vice President of Lockheed Martin's Aeronautics business area. He has over 38 years of experience in the aerospace and defense industry.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Patricia%20Yarrington\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Patricia Yarrington</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2021</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Retired Vice President and CFO of Chevron Corporation.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Richard%20Ambrose\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Richard Ambrose</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">~2002</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Executive Vice President, Space</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Former Executive Vice President, Space of Lockheed Martin Corporation. He served in various leadership roles at Lockheed Martin from 2000 to 2022.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Vicki%20Hollub\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Vicki Hollub</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">June 2018</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Member, Board of Directors</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">President and CEO of Occidental Petroleum Corporation.</p></div><h2 style=\"margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">Directors</h2><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/James%20Taiclet\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">James Taiclet</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">June 2020</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chairman</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Chairman, President and CEO of Lockheed Martin.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Daniel%20Akerson\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Daniel Akerson</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">February 2014</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Former Chairman and CEO of General Motors Company.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/David%20Burritt\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">David Burritt</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2008</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">President and CEO of United States Steel Corporation.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Bruce%20Carlson\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Bruce Carlson</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2015</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size